
# <Type>: <subject>
#
# Why: <motivation, context, anything a reader needs in 6 months>
#
# What: - <change 1>
# - <change 2>
#
# Types: Add, Change, Fix, Refactor, Remove, Test, Docs, Style, Perf, Build,
#        CI, Chore. Optional scope: Fix[hints]: ...
# Title: 20-80 chars, imperative mood ("add", not "added"), no final period,
#        subject starts lowercase.
# Body:  lines <= 80 chars, one blank line between sections.
# No AI attribution lines. Never bypass hooks with --no-verify.
